An extern-template-declared copy constructor whose class also has a
constructor taking an alias of a nested incomplete class-template
chain (with a clang-builtin __remove_reference_t default argument)
aborts typecheck_method_application ("expr.function().id() ==
ID_member") when the copy constructor is used.  Reduced from a
preprocessed libc++ <vector> driver; this crash masks every
preprocessed-libc++ reduction (vector semantic family,
cpp20_ranges_basic_libcxx's silent drop, cpp11_set_insert_libcxx).
clang++/valgrind clean (clang-only builtin; g++ n/a).
